WEBVTT

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:14.432
I've come all this way.

00:00:17.226 --> 00:00:18.644
Shana.

00:00:21.689 --> 00:00:23.107
Yuji.

00:00:36.621 --> 00:00:39.207
Is that Sakai-kun?

00:00:46.547 --> 00:00:48.674
Who are you?

00:00:48.883 --> 00:00:53.304
I'm disappointed you don't
recognize me, Flame of the Heavens.

00:00:53.512 --> 00:00:54.931
What?

00:00:55.723 --> 00:00:58.601
No. I suppose it makes sense.

00:00:58.809 --> 00:01:02.688
You came to this world after I did.

00:01:02.897 --> 00:01:05.274
The words I spoke and the sound of my voice

00:01:05.483 --> 00:01:07.652
were never something you heard directly.

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:10.071
Who are you?

00:01:10.279 --> 00:01:14.700
It's probably some toy that
three-eyed woman cooked up.

00:01:14.909 --> 00:01:16.911
Carrying that "Silver."

00:01:17.119 --> 00:01:22.124
This time I'm going to catch
you and make you tell me everything!

00:01:22.333 --> 00:01:26.337
Brainwashed. Or perhaps someone has...

00:01:26.545 --> 00:01:29.215
...possessed him, it seems, indeed.

00:01:29.423 --> 00:01:31.050
Foolish act.

00:01:32.134 --> 00:01:36.639
Neither of those is true,
Carmel-san. Margery-san.

00:01:36.847 --> 00:01:38.808
I wonder.

00:01:39.016 --> 00:01:42.812
Then are you Yuji Sakai?

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:46.524
Yes. I am Yuji Sakai.

00:01:46.732 --> 00:01:50.569
But this is the name I use in this world.

00:01:50.778 --> 00:01:52.655
I have a true name as well, of course.

00:01:52.863 --> 00:01:53.823
A true name?

00:01:54.031 --> 00:01:55.074
What do you mean?

00:01:55.283 --> 00:01:57.702
Who are you?

00:01:57.910 --> 00:02:00.246
You'll understand if I show you this.

00:02:00.454 --> 00:02:02.081
This flame.

00:02:07.545 --> 00:02:08.963
Seal.

00:02:31.944 --> 00:02:33.696
Black flame...

00:02:33.904 --> 00:02:37.616
Yes. This is my flame. And...

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:47.293
This is the form I take now.

00:02:47.501 --> 00:02:53.007
Call me thus, the Snake
of the Festival, Yuji Sakai.

00:03:10.274 --> 00:03:13.903
<i>Now set free</i>

00:03:14.111 --> 00:03:20.284
<i>Your hidden feelings</i>

00:03:20.493 --> 00:03:24.163
<i>So that you may sever</i>

00:03:24.372 --> 00:03:30.211
<i>Reality that returns to nothingness</i>

00:03:30.419 --> 00:03:32.755
<i>Even if fate is inevitable</i>

00:03:32.963 --> 00:03:35.383
<i>Nobody can predict what will happen</i>

00:03:35.591 --> 00:03:37.927
<i>Defy it with all you've got</i>

00:03:38.135 --> 00:03:42.807
<i>Grasp the future reflected in</i>

00:03:43.015 --> 00:03:45.351
<i>Your eyes with your own hands</i>

00:03:45.559 --> 00:03:48.020
<i>Shout out</i>

00:03:48.229 --> 00:03:50.648
<i>Your existence</i>

00:03:50.856 --> 00:03:55.736
<i>Cry out</i>

00:03:55.945 --> 00:03:58.155
<i>Shout out</i>

00:03:58.531 --> 00:04:00.908
<i>Shout out</i>

00:04:01.117 --> 00:04:03.494
<i>No matter what hardship</i>

00:04:03.702 --> 00:04:11.627
<i>Awaits us down the way</i>

00:04:11.836 --> 00:04:18.217
<i>Light my fire</i>

00:04:28.144 --> 00:04:31.772
The Snake of the Festival? Impossible.

00:04:31.981 --> 00:04:33.441
The Creator God...

00:04:33.649 --> 00:04:36.026
Yes. I am what you would call

00:04:36.235 --> 00:04:39.989
the counterpart to the
God of Atonement Alastor,

00:04:40.197 --> 00:04:42.199
the Flame of the Heavens.

00:04:42.408 --> 00:04:45.494
I am the Snake of the Festival.

00:04:45.703 --> 00:04:47.121
But you grew arrogant in your power,

00:04:47.329 --> 00:04:51.250
and dared alter the
foundations of the world itself.

00:04:51.459 --> 00:04:57.923
And the ancient Flame Hazes
sealed you in the eternal pit.

00:04:58.132 --> 00:05:03.679
So what's a God doing here who
was banished forever in an old fairytale?

00:05:03.888 --> 00:05:08.434
That place is a gap between worlds where
none of the laws of the universe apply,

00:05:08.642 --> 00:05:10.227
and even the Gods are helpless.

00:05:10.436 --> 00:05:12.980
Ball Masque acts without a master.

00:05:13.189 --> 00:05:15.483
So that was it, indeed.

00:05:15.691 --> 00:05:17.526
Unexamined possibility.

00:05:26.702 --> 00:05:28.120
Shana“.

00:05:32.374 --> 00:05:35.294
No... no!

00:05:42.134 --> 00:05:43.677
You aren't Yuji!

00:05:43.886 --> 00:05:48.516
No. I am Yuji Sakai, Shana.

00:06:03.822 --> 00:06:05.950
We'll talk after we've captured him, indeed.

00:06:06.158 --> 00:06:07.785
Dangerous threat.

00:06:12.706 --> 00:06:14.625
That's right!

00:06:25.135 --> 00:06:26.595
Yuji!

00:06:26.804 --> 00:06:28.847
Whether he's lying or not,

00:06:29.056 --> 00:06:32.351
he called himself one of the
most legendary monsters in history.

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:35.563
Who knows what he'll do.

00:06:35.771 --> 00:06:37.106
What's going on?

00:06:37.314 --> 00:06:40.609
Is some weird monster
pretending to be Yuji?

00:06:40.818 --> 00:06:41.777
No.

00:06:41.986 --> 00:06:44.029
I'm sure that's not it.

00:06:44.238 --> 00:06:47.032
I can tell from Shana-chan's voice.

00:06:47.241 --> 00:06:49.577
What she's seeing in front of her now

00:06:49.785 --> 00:06:51.495
is Sakai-kun!

00:06:54.915 --> 00:06:57.876
"Reunions and Chance Meetings"

00:07:11.015 --> 00:07:12.850
I'm sorry...

00:07:17.688 --> 00:07:20.524
...but I'm only here for Shana.

00:07:42.338 --> 00:07:44.340
We've been locked in!

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:47.468
Shana.

00:07:47.676 --> 00:07:49.303
<i>Yum...</i>

00:07:56.226 --> 00:07:57.853
Let me go!

00:08:01.106 --> 00:08:02.399
Snake of the Festival!

00:08:02.608 --> 00:08:06.654
What kind of foolishness do
you intend, appearing like this?

00:08:06.862 --> 00:08:08.989
It's not a joke.

00:08:09.198 --> 00:08:11.909
We both needed each other.

00:08:14.119 --> 00:08:16.872
Don't speak in his voice!

00:08:17.081 --> 00:08:19.833
Shana. Come with me.

00:08:20.042 --> 00:08:21.502
I've come for you.

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:23.003
You bastard...

00:08:23.212 --> 00:08:25.089
I want to go with you.

00:08:25.297 --> 00:08:27.966
Why? Why?

00:08:28.175 --> 00:08:30.344
Why are you saying that now?

00:08:30.552 --> 00:08:34.014
No. I can say it now when I couldn't before.

00:08:34.223 --> 00:08:36.183
Now I can.

00:08:39.478 --> 00:08:43.982
Impressive. That won't
be enough to stop them...

00:08:48.237 --> 00:08:49.655
I see.

00:08:52.157 --> 00:08:54.785
Is this the only way then?

00:08:54.993 --> 00:08:56.995
Wait, Shana.

00:09:15.431 --> 00:09:17.850
Humpty-dumpty sat on his wall!

00:09:18.058 --> 00:09:20.602
Humpty-dumpty had a great fall!

00:09:20.811 --> 00:09:22.563
And all the king's horses

00:09:22.771 --> 00:09:24.857
and all the king's men!

00:09:25.065 --> 00:09:28.068
Couldn't put Humpty together again!

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:36.702
I can't be bothered
right now, Margery-san.

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:40.330
Would you stay put for a while?

00:09:40.539 --> 00:09:42.458
Of course not!

00:09:42.666 --> 00:09:45.711
Then, why don't you
hear what I have to say?

00:09:47.129 --> 00:09:50.048
There's something I've
learned since I've come here.

00:09:50.257 --> 00:09:53.969
You'd want to hear it too, I'm sure.

00:09:54.178 --> 00:09:57.055
About Silver.

00:09:58.474 --> 00:10:01.059
Silver? What... What?

00:10:01.268 --> 00:10:03.103
Margery, Shut "P!

00:10:03.312 --> 00:10:04.480
What do you know about Silver?

00:10:04.688 --> 00:10:06.231
You mustn't listen!

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:11.361
He's telling you that because he
knows it's what you want to hear first.

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:12.446
False information.

00:10:12.654 --> 00:10:15.115
Shut up! I want to hear it!

00:10:15.324 --> 00:10:17.159
I want to hear it!

00:10:17.367 --> 00:10:18.827
Then I'll tell you.

00:10:19.036 --> 00:10:22.372
<i>Yum. w. Yum!</i>

00:10:22.581 --> 00:10:23.999
About Silver.

00:10:24.208 --> 00:10:26.210
Yuji!

00:10:27.628 --> 00:10:30.047
What do you know about Silver?

00:10:30.255 --> 00:10:33.133
First, look around you.

00:10:44.311 --> 00:10:47.856
What looks to you like a
suit of armor is not a Denizen.

00:10:48.065 --> 00:10:51.819
It's a physical manifestation of emotional
fragments gathered from humans.

00:10:52.027 --> 00:10:55.322
You might say it's the form their hearts take.

00:11:01.537 --> 00:11:05.833
These countless fragments

00:11:06.041 --> 00:11:10.796
are the parts that make up the
mechanisms tracing out my identity.

00:11:11.004 --> 00:11:14.675
This armor appears before
those who possess strong emotions

00:11:14.883 --> 00:11:17.761
without any manifest will of its own.

00:11:25.561 --> 00:11:30.607
It carries out the desires and wishes
of the one it seeks to draw emotions from,

00:11:30.816 --> 00:11:33.443
and thus reflects those emotions.

00:11:33.652 --> 00:11:35.654
It has no mind of its own.

00:11:46.915 --> 00:11:51.003
What you saw was the
physical form of your hate.

00:11:51.211 --> 00:11:55.507
The sneer you saw
was your own secret desire.

00:11:55.716 --> 00:11:57.593
Do you understand?

00:11:57.801 --> 00:12:00.262
The Silver you saw

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:05.976
did what you really wanted to do yourself.

00:12:06.184 --> 00:12:10.355
That was... me...

00:12:14.318 --> 00:12:16.320
It's over.

00:12:16.528 --> 00:12:17.946
Yuji.

00:12:27.706 --> 00:12:29.333
Arouse wariness.

00:12:51.647 --> 00:12:52.314
Big Sister!

00:12:52.522 --> 00:12:54.650
What's wrong? Big Sister!

00:12:54.858 --> 00:13:00.072
The Chanter of Elegies has received
information that has badly shaken her, indeed.

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:03.533
She is in a dangerous state, indeed.

00:13:03.742 --> 00:13:05.577
Collapse possible.

00:13:10.248 --> 00:13:11.833
Get a hold of yourself, indeed.

00:13:12.042 --> 00:13:13.085
Maintain will.

00:13:13.293 --> 00:13:15.921
Oh no! The contract is about to break!

00:13:16.129 --> 00:13:19.800
Hey, Margery! Is this
how you want things to end?

00:13:20.008 --> 00:13:22.636
Do you want to die here?

00:13:22.844 --> 00:13:25.013
It's no good, she won't listen to me!

00:13:25.222 --> 00:13:28.725
Big Sister! Big Sister, don't die! Big Sister!

00:13:41.154 --> 00:13:44.658
Ever since I can remember,

00:13:45.867 --> 00:13:47.869
I was always relied on...

00:13:49.913 --> 00:13:52.124
I helped and was betrayed,

00:13:53.875 --> 00:13:56.712
and then was relied on again.

00:13:58.422 --> 00:14:00.924
I was sick of it.

00:14:01.133 --> 00:14:05.345
And sick of myself for
willingly going along with it.

00:14:06.596 --> 00:14:09.641
That's why I hated him.

00:14:10.892 --> 00:14:16.398
He destroyed everything
I wanted to destroy.

00:14:18.483 --> 00:14:20.110
But...

00:14:30.662 --> 00:14:33.999
I'd destroyed it all myself.

00:14:34.207 --> 00:14:38.086
Then, it's all over!

00:14:38.295 --> 00:14:42.215
No! Don't die, Big Sister!

00:14:42.424 --> 00:14:44.968
Why shouldn't I?

00:14:45.177 --> 00:14:47.054
You still want to use me?

00:14:47.262 --> 00:14:49.264
Sato still hasn't...

00:14:50.557 --> 00:14:53.435
He still hasn't done anything for you!

00:14:53.643 --> 00:14:55.270
Margery-san!

00:14:55.479 --> 00:14:58.148
Think about Sato-kun!

00:14:58.356 --> 00:15:00.525
Please, realize those feelings!

00:15:00.734 --> 00:15:05.072
You've been loved for a long time!

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:07.491
My.“

00:15:07.699 --> 00:15:08.492
Big Sister!

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:10.327
Don't die!

00:15:13.538 --> 00:15:15.957
Margery-san can't fight anymore.

00:15:16.166 --> 00:15:19.461
And Carmel-san won't be able
to do much more than protect herself.

00:15:19.669 --> 00:15:21.505
Now we're finally alone.

00:15:21.713 --> 00:15:23.131
<i>Yum...</i>

00:15:23.632 --> 00:15:25.133
MN'

00:15:25.342 --> 00:15:27.344
---9°in91:0 destroy you!

00:15:33.225 --> 00:15:35.227
The Blutsauger...

00:15:53.912 --> 00:15:57.499
Shana. You're never going
to give up, are you?

00:15:57.707 --> 00:15:58.959
Shut up.

00:15:59.167 --> 00:16:03.004
That's why the only path between us is battle.

00:16:03.213 --> 00:16:04.714
Shut up!

00:16:06.007 --> 00:16:09.386
I'm going to fight,
and follow this path to where you are!

00:16:09.594 --> 00:16:11.221
Shut up!

00:16:25.152 --> 00:16:26.319
This is hard.

00:16:26.528 --> 00:16:30.407
Any time before now
Yuji would've done something...

00:16:30.615 --> 00:16:31.783
No!

00:16:31.992 --> 00:16:34.286
Yuji knows my powers.

00:16:50.802 --> 00:16:53.263
How much can I materialize?

00:17:03.815 --> 00:17:04.816
That's...

00:17:04.816 --> 00:17:06.109
"Sakai"

00:17:07.402 --> 00:17:08.820
Shana.

00:17:09.571 --> 00:17:10.989
Yuji.

00:17:11.573 --> 00:17:14.618
What will you do about Chigusa?

00:17:14.826 --> 00:17:17.579
I've already left on my journey.

00:17:17.787 --> 00:17:20.874
You're not a puppet,
you're doing it of your own will?

00:17:21.082 --> 00:17:25.503
That's right. Of that
one thing, you may be certain.

00:17:26.963 --> 00:17:32.010
Can you protect all
the people you love, Shana?

00:17:32.219 --> 00:17:33.762
If...

00:17:33.970 --> 00:17:35.430
If your mother or father were attacked

00:17:35.639 --> 00:17:38.350
by a Denizen somewhere,
what would you do?

00:17:38.558 --> 00:17:42.103
Can you put Flame Haze
guards on everyone you know?

00:17:42.312 --> 00:17:43.980
<i>'An.</i>

00:17:44.189 --> 00:17:47.067
This world is too large to protect.

00:17:47.275 --> 00:17:50.278
Just living in Misaki City
for over a decade

00:17:50.487 --> 00:17:52.989
I've met so many people I have to protect,

00:17:53.198 --> 00:17:55.033
I want to protect.

00:17:55.242 --> 00:17:56.826
That's why...

00:17:57.035 --> 00:17:59.871
I'm going to change
what's real in this world.

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:03.124
I'm going to eliminate that
unreasonable possibility from the world.

00:18:03.333 --> 00:18:07.504
To protect the person...
the people I love!

00:18:09.005 --> 00:18:10.590
Shana!

00:18:10.799 --> 00:18:14.761
You're only a tool of destruction,
but I count you among them.

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:19.099
A Flame Haze fights, and fights,
until someday they run out of luck,

00:18:19.307 --> 00:18:21.977
and then they just disappear.

00:18:22.185 --> 00:18:25.188
I'm going to change
the destiny you've been given.

00:18:26.690 --> 00:18:28.692
I'm going to protect you.

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:33.071
And so I won't let you stop me.

00:18:33.280 --> 00:18:38.201
I want you to be by my
side as the world changes.

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:40.036
<i>Yum...</i>

00:18:41.079 --> 00:18:45.375
Shana. I've always dreamed
of walking together with you.

00:18:45.583 --> 00:18:50.338
I've become stronger.
Much, much stronger, like you wanted.

00:18:50.547 --> 00:18:52.924
So now I begin a battle

00:18:53.133 --> 00:18:55.719
to walk with you and protect you!

00:19:25.999 --> 00:19:27.417
It's moving this way!

00:19:27.625 --> 00:19:29.753
Yoshida-san, we need to get out of here!

00:19:31.338 --> 00:19:34.341
Sakai-kun is coming!

00:19:42.432 --> 00:19:45.602
I'm sorry. I didn't know you were here.

00:19:51.816 --> 00:19:54.819
S-Sakai!

00:19:56.071 --> 00:19:57.781
Shana-chan!

00:19:57.989 --> 00:20:01.743
You... saved her, right?

00:20:01.951 --> 00:20:03.953
Shana is fine.

00:20:04.162 --> 00:20:06.831
I'm about to take her back.

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:10.335
I came here to reclaim this.

00:20:19.636 --> 00:20:21.304
Sakai! That's...

00:20:21.513 --> 00:20:23.098
What's wrong with me taking it?

00:20:23.306 --> 00:20:26.309
It's mine to begin with.

00:20:29.229 --> 00:20:30.647
Wait!

00:20:31.356 --> 00:20:34.651
Sakai-kun, um...

00:20:34.859 --> 00:20:38.029
When you said take her back,
you meant Shana-chan?

00:20:38.238 --> 00:20:39.656
Yes.

00:20:43.868 --> 00:20:46.788
Why did that letter...

00:20:46.996 --> 00:20:49.541
Because I promised.

00:20:49.749 --> 00:20:52.544
That if nothing else,
I would say something.

00:20:52.752 --> 00:20:55.588
That I would tell everything.

00:20:57.424 --> 00:20:59.884
I couldn't say something
that would make you unhappy.

00:21:00.093 --> 00:21:03.430
But I would tell you what I could.

00:21:03.638 --> 00:21:05.640
That was my thought.

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:12.439
<i>I must be dreaming tonight.</i>

00:21:12.439 --> 00:21:14.691
If you can go back home, you should.

00:21:14.691 --> 00:21:17.986
<i>We erase it from our memories</i>

00:21:17.986 --> 00:21:18.111
I haven't changed anything yet,

00:21:18.194 --> 00:21:19.696
<i>You can't escape</i>

00:21:19.696 --> 00:21:21.489
but it's much better
than being in a place like this.

00:21:21.489 --> 00:21:25.201
<i>I only know this secret with you</i>

00:21:29.497 --> 00:21:34.586
<i>How can I protect you forever?</i>

00:21:34.794 --> 00:21:36.045
<i>Close your eyes</i>

00:21:36.254 --> 00:21:40.216
<i>I'll be anything for you</i>

00:21:40.425 --> 00:21:42.427
<i>I can't live this life</i>

00:21:42.635 --> 00:21:48.016
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:21:48.016 --> 00:21:50.018
Shana, let's go.

00:21:50.143 --> 00:21:54.189
<i>“I'll believe..."</i>

00:21:58.943 --> 00:22:01.905
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:22:02.113 --> 00:22:05.492
<i>ls also inside of me
(I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:22:05.700 --> 00:22:08.661
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:22:08.870 --> 00:22:14.626
<i>It is the reason why I continue to exist</i>

00:22:14.834 --> 00:22:15.919
<i>Inside of Kaos I say</i>

00:22:16.127 --> 00:22:19.214
<i>Where can I get the
real love and fate, right now?</i>

00:22:19.422 --> 00:22:22.550
<i>How can I make you
know my heart is with you hey?</i>

00:22:22.759 --> 00:22:25.970
<i>All people, everyone, forget things,</i>

00:22:26.179 --> 00:22:29.349
<i>Even their aching scars</i>

00:22:29.557 --> 00:22:32.685
<i>Each time I see the passage of time,</i>

00:22:32.894 --> 00:22:36.064
<i>These emotions fade</i>

00:22:36.272 --> 00:22:39.984
<i>But I don't want to overlook things any longer</i>

00:22:40.193 --> 00:22:42.904
<i>Back and forth, the screaming
in my heart won't stop (time over)</i>

00:22:43.112 --> 00:22:51.162
<i>The vanishing afterimage, that is you
in and of itself (So now that you & I)</i>

00:22:51.371 --> 00:22:52.413
<i>I can't live life</i>

00:22:52.622 --> 00:22:54.374
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:22:54.582 --> 00:22:58.002
<i>“I'll believe..." Even in the
fatality of solitude (Yeah, yeah)</i>

00:22:58.211 --> 00:23:01.339
<i>The fragments of the burning records</i>

00:23:01.548 --> 00:23:04.759
<i>Reflect tomorrow's brightness
(Can see your light)</i>

00:23:04.968 --> 00:23:07.804
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:23:08.012 --> 00:23:11.558
<i>ls also inside of me
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:23:11.766 --> 00:23:14.686
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:23:14.894 --> 00:23:23.403
<i>“I'll believe..." in a tomorrow
where we coexist (Yeah, "I'll believe")</i>

00:23:26.990 --> 00:23:28.992
Shana is trapped in the Palace of the Stars.

00:23:29.200 --> 00:23:30.952
Margery withdraws from the battle,

00:23:31.160 --> 00:23:35.373
and Wilhelmina makes
a plan to recover Shana alone.

00:23:35.582 --> 00:23:37.792
Next time on Shakugan no Shana Final:

00:23:38.001 --> 00:23:40.837
"The Captured Flame Haze."
